  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell creates a shimmering, magical field around the target that averts and deflects attacks. The spell grants the subject a +2 deflection bonus to AC, with an additional +1 to the bonus for every six levels you have (maximum +5 deflection bonus at 18th level).Mythic Shield of FaithSource Mythic Adventures pg. 108\nAdd half your tier to the spell’s deflection bonus.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell creates a shimmering, magical field around the target that averts and deflects attacks. the spell grants the subject a +2 deflection bonus to ac, with an additional +1 to the bonus for every six levels you have (maximum +5 deflection bonus at 18th level).mythic shield of faithsource mythic adventures pg. 108\\nadd half your tier to the spell’s deflection bonus.\"",
